      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKODA BONNIE (7) is in hot form after clocking an excellent 19.69 victory two back then followed up with a 25.40 win at Q Lakeside over 457m last time. In form and looks the one to beat again. SASSY SANDY (1) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 4 lengths into third (19.97) at this track in a Grade 5 over 366m. Expected to be in this for a long way. WISHING STAR (3) did a good job to finish third last time out over 457m at Q Lakeside (25.62) in a OPEN, the second top-three finish on the trot. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. ARCANE (8) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
